WEBVTT

00:00:05.887 --> 00:00:07.845
[SOFTLY] I miss you already.

00:00:08.368 --> 00:00:09.369
Ow!

00:00:13.242 --> 00:00:14.896
[SIGHS]

00:00:14.939 --> 00:00:16.724
I think the king
really likes us.

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:18.160
I know, right?

00:00:18.204 --> 00:00:20.510
That was the greatest day
of my life!

00:00:21.207 --> 00:00:22.164
Thanks, Poppy.

00:00:23.252 --> 00:00:24.993
Thanks to all of you!

00:00:25.036 --> 00:00:27.561
Even you, I guess.

00:00:27.604 --> 00:00:29.824
I just never thought
something like that
could happen to me.

00:00:29.867 --> 00:00:31.652
And it just did!

00:00:31.695 --> 00:00:33.915
I'm so excited
I could just scream.

00:00:35.046 --> 00:00:37.005
[SCREAMING INAUDIBLY]

00:00:37.048 --> 00:00:39.703
Oh, I could scream too!
Creek is alive!

00:00:39.747 --> 00:00:41.052
Yay![ALL CHEERING]

00:00:42.706 --> 00:00:44.186
[OFF-KEY CHEERING]

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:50.105
Branch, what's wrong?

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:52.412
Nothing. I thought
we were celebrating.

00:00:52.455 --> 00:00:53.935
That's your happy shout?

00:00:53.978 --> 00:00:55.502
It's been a while.

00:00:55.545 --> 00:00:57.199
Well, you're gonna
have plenty of practice,

00:00:57.243 --> 00:00:58.766
because we're gonna
save Creek...

00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:01.203
and life will be all
cupcakes and rainbows again.

00:01:01.247 --> 00:01:02.335
Up top!

00:01:02.378 --> 00:01:03.553
Too slow.

00:01:03.597 --> 00:01:05.076
CHENILLE: Yes!SATIN: I knew it!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:06.252
Okay, everybody...

00:01:06.295 --> 00:01:09.255
let's go save Creek.

00:01:09.298 --> 00:01:11.039
No! No! You can't leave.

00:01:11.082 --> 00:01:12.345
Lady Glittersparkles
is gonna be

00:01:12.388 --> 00:01:14.042
the king's plus one
at dinner.

00:01:14.085 --> 00:01:15.435
The dinner
where they're serving Troll?

00:01:15.478 --> 00:01:17.524
Yeah, I think we're gonna
have to skip that one.

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:20.396
No! No, you have to help me
be Lady Glittersparkles.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:22.093
I need you.

00:01:22.137 --> 00:01:24.139
You don't wanna
pretend to be someone
you're not forever!

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:26.359
Then how about
just for tomorrow?

00:01:26.402 --> 00:01:28.056
Bridget,
you don't need us anymore.

00:01:28.099 --> 00:01:30.406
You and the king
can make each other happy!

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:31.625
That's impossible!

00:01:31.668 --> 00:01:33.757
Only eating a Troll
can make you happy.

00:01:33.801 --> 00:01:35.542
Everyone knows that!

00:01:35.585 --> 00:01:38.197
I wish I'd never
gone on this stupid date!

00:01:39.023 --> 00:01:40.460
[CRYING]

00:01:40.503 --> 00:01:41.722
Bridget...

00:01:41.765 --> 00:01:45.029
Just go!
Get out of my room.
Leave me alone.

00:01:45.073 --> 00:01:46.074
Please, listen.

00:01:46.117 --> 00:01:47.597
CHEF: Bridget!

00:01:47.641 --> 00:01:48.990
We've gotta go.Bridget...

00:01:49.033 --> 00:01:50.600
CHEF: What's going on
down there?

00:01:50.644 --> 00:01:53.473
Bridget, scrub that dish!

00:01:53.516 --> 00:01:56.302
The king's bringing
a plus one.

00:01:56.345 --> 00:01:57.955
Yes, Chef.
[SOBBING]

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:07.922
We can do this, Barnabus.

00:02:07.965 --> 00:02:11.534
I just have to lose 30 pounds
in the next eight hours.

00:02:13.144 --> 00:02:14.537
[I FEEL LOVE
PLAYING ON HEADPHONES]

00:02:29.073 --> 00:02:30.292
There it is!

00:02:30.336 --> 00:02:31.815
♪ Oh...

00:02:33.469 --> 00:02:35.602
♪ I feel good
I feel good

00:02:35.645 --> 00:02:37.168
♪ I feel good
I feel good

00:02:37.212 --> 00:02:40.998
♪ I feel good

00:02:41.042 --> 00:02:43.000
Creek, we'll have you
out of there in a second.

00:02:43.044 --> 00:02:44.959
Hurry!It's stuck!

00:02:45.002 --> 00:02:46.613
[GROWLING]

00:02:46.656 --> 00:02:47.657
Run!

00:02:47.701 --> 00:02:49.006
[TROLLS SCREAMING]

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:50.312
[INAUDIBLE][MUSIC BLARING ON HEADPHONES]

00:02:51.226 --> 00:02:55.491
♪ I feel love

00:02:58.842 --> 00:03:00.931
Hey, guys! Over here![GROWLING]

00:03:02.368 --> 00:03:03.456
Everyone, get in!Let's go.

00:03:03.499 --> 00:03:04.718
Branch,
give him to me.Go!

00:03:04.761 --> 00:03:06.328
Just go!

00:03:06.372 --> 00:03:07.721
BRANCH: Everybody hold on!

00:03:11.377 --> 00:03:13.248
BIGGIE: Hold it steady, guys.

00:03:15.685 --> 00:03:17.470
Satin, Chenille,
sharp right!

00:03:17.513 --> 00:03:18.514
Let's do it!

00:03:23.258 --> 00:03:24.825
Guy Diamond,
glitter him!

00:03:24.868 --> 00:03:26.740
Eat glitter!

00:03:27.523 --> 00:03:28.524
Ha-ha.

00:03:31.048 --> 00:03:33.137
Look![ALL SCREAMING]

00:03:33.181 --> 00:03:34.182
Hold on!

00:03:34.704 --> 00:03:35.705
[ALL YELP]

00:03:38.404 --> 00:03:39.535
Creek![ALL GASP]

00:03:45.454 --> 00:03:46.542
[GASPS]

00:03:47.587 --> 00:03:48.762
Branch! [GRUNTS]

00:03:52.766 --> 00:03:53.767
BIGGIE: We got you!

00:03:55.421 --> 00:03:56.726
[ALL SCREAMING]

00:04:06.606 --> 00:04:07.737
Gotcha!

00:04:11.654 --> 00:04:13.308
BRANCH: Huh?[POPPY GASPS]

00:04:13.352 --> 00:04:14.788
No!

00:04:14.831 --> 00:04:16.877
He can't be gone.

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:19.227
I'm sorry, Poppy.
We're too late.

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:20.315
CHEF: Actually...

00:04:20.359 --> 00:04:23.274
your timing is perfect.

00:04:25.929 --> 00:04:28.279
[BIGGIE WHIMPERING]

00:04:28.323 --> 00:04:30.717
Sorry,
but I can't have you leaving

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:32.414
before tomorrow's dinner.

00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:34.982
A dinner to which
you are all invited.

00:04:35.025 --> 00:04:36.418
And when I say all...

00:04:36.462 --> 00:04:39.639
I mean every Troll
in Troll Village.

00:04:39.682 --> 00:04:42.032
You'll never find them.
Not where they're hiding.

00:04:43.469 --> 00:04:46.297
Oh, you're right.
I couldn't find them.

00:04:46.341 --> 00:04:49.605
But I could
with someone they know.

00:04:49.649 --> 00:04:51.433
Someone they trust.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.044
Someone...

00:04:55.132 --> 00:04:56.569
like this guy.

00:04:56.612 --> 00:04:58.745
Creek!
You're alive!

00:04:58.788 --> 00:04:59.920
DJ SUKI: He's so cool.

00:04:59.963 --> 00:05:00.964
BIGGIE: Yes!

00:05:02.488 --> 00:05:04.272
He's selling us out!

00:05:04.315 --> 00:05:05.491
POPPY: Branch! Wait![CHOKING]

00:05:05.534 --> 00:05:07.667
I'm sure there's
a reasonable explanation.

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:09.277
At least give him a chance.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:10.713
Thank you, Poppy.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.150
I'm selling you out.

00:05:13.977 --> 00:05:15.370
[CHOKING]

00:05:15.414 --> 00:05:17.067
No, stop! No, wait!

00:05:17.894 --> 00:05:19.461
[GASPING]

00:05:19.505 --> 00:05:22.464
You better
explain yourself, Creek!

00:05:22.508 --> 00:05:25.162
As I was about to
accept my fate...

00:05:25.206 --> 00:05:28.165
I had, what I can
only describe as...

00:05:28.209 --> 00:05:31.212
a spiritual awakening.

00:05:31.255 --> 00:05:32.431
I don't wanna die!

00:05:32.996 --> 00:05:34.520
Don't eat me.

00:05:34.563 --> 00:05:38.219
Eat someone else. Anyone else.
Everyone else. But not me!

00:05:38.262 --> 00:05:40.482
But the king
wants to be happy now.

00:05:40.526 --> 00:05:43.790
Wait! Wait!
There must be
some other way.

00:05:43.833 --> 00:05:46.270
I'll do anything.

00:05:47.533 --> 00:05:48.490
Hmm...

00:05:50.057 --> 00:05:54.191
No! Creek,
please don't do this.

00:05:54.235 --> 00:05:55.715
Believe me...

00:05:55.758 --> 00:06:00.154
I wish there was some other
me-not-getting-eaten way.

00:06:00.197 --> 00:06:02.504
But there isn't.

00:06:02.548 --> 00:06:06.073
And now I have to live with
this for the rest of my life.

00:06:06.116 --> 00:06:09.816
At least you get to die
with a clear conscience.

00:06:09.859 --> 00:06:11.470
So, in a way...

00:06:12.079 --> 00:06:14.037
you could say...

00:06:14.081 --> 00:06:15.952
I'm doing this for you.

00:06:20.391 --> 00:06:21.523
Boop!

00:06:21.567 --> 00:06:22.916
[TROLLS GASPING]

00:06:26.789 --> 00:06:28.095
[COWBELL BANGING RHYTHMICALLY]

00:06:28.138 --> 00:06:29.226
[SHUSHING]

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:33.187
Listen.
It's Poppy's cowbell!

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:35.015
My baby did it!

00:06:35.058 --> 00:06:36.886
Poppy did it!

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:37.931
Ha-ha.

00:06:40.063 --> 00:06:41.412
Creek?

00:06:48.289 --> 00:06:49.508
Uh-oh.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.162
[TROLLS CLAMORING]

00:06:55.165 --> 00:06:59.953
ALL: [CHANTING] Trollstice!
Trollstice! Trollstice!

